  - elementId: slide-11-node-235-Text-8
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50.4
      - 147.6
      - 410.4
      - 345.6
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#DB2777'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">灰度输入适配  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">第一层 conv1 由 RGB (3→64) 改为 1→64; 权重由 ImageNet 预训练的 RGB 卷积核沿通道维取均值初始化: new_w = old_w.mean(dim=1, keepdim=True)。这样灰度输入也能继承预训练的边缘/纹理表征能力。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">layer4 空洞改造  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">layer4 stride 改为 1, 并用 dilation 替代下采样, 使深层仍保持 H/16 分辨率, 避免高反光语义被过度下采样。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">通道压缩  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">对 layer1/2/3 输出分别加 reduce_l1/l2/l3 (1×1 Conv) 把 256/512/1024 通道压到 128/256/512, 便于解码器使用。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">末层融合  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">x_l3_512 与 x_l4_512 都是 H/16 × 512, 通过 cat + fuse_l34 (Conv 1×1) 合并为 512 通道的 x_bb_4。该融合让浅层与深层 H/16 语义同时进入瓶颈。</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: 0444540b0366c5bf6dd23876d86c3b799967d14c9ddea9555adb05ab89839437
